{"seq":3,"slug":"cli-tool-development","title":"命令行工具开发","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"命令行工具开发-简介\">命令行工具开发 简介</h1><p>命令行工具是开发者日常工作中最核心的效率载体。从 Git 到 Docker，从 curl 到 ripgrep，优秀的 CLI 工具以简洁的接口、可组合的设计和高效的执行，深刻影响着整个软件行业的工作流。掌握命令行工具的设计与开发，意味着具备将复杂逻辑封装为直觉化操作的能力。</p>\n<p>本手册面向有一定编程基础、希望系统学习 CLI 工具开发的软件工程师。无论你使用 Rust、Node.js 还是其他语言，这里都提供了从设计理念到工程实践的完整知识体系。已有 CLI 开发经验的读者可以直接跳转到感兴趣的章节深入阅读。</p>\n<p>全书分为五个章节，覆盖 CLI 工具开发的完整生命周期：</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」奠定理论根基，从 Unix 哲学和 POSIX 约定出发，讲解参数解析、IO 流处理和错误处理等核心技能。这些原则适用于任何语言和平台。</p>\n<p>第二章「用户体验」聚焦 CLI 的交互层，涵盖交互式提示、进度动画、颜色格式化和帮助系统的设计。好的 CLI 工具不仅功能强大，更应该让用户感到愉悦。</p>\n<p>第三章「Rust CLI」深入 Rust 生态的 CLI 开发，从 Clap 参数解析到 Tokio 异步运行时，再到交叉编译和二进制优化，展示如何用 Rust 构建高性能的命令行工具。</p>\n<p>第四章「Node.js CLI」探索 JavaScript 生态的 CLI 开发方式，包括项目架构、进程管理、配置系统和打包分发策略，适合前端工程师快速上手。</p>\n<p>第五章「测试与发布」覆盖 CLI 工具的质量保障和分发流程，从测试策略到 CI 发布流水线，从 Homebrew 分发到版本管理，确保你的工具能够可靠地交付到用户手中。</p>\n<p>建议按章节顺序阅读基础部分，之后根据技术栈选择 Rust 或 Node.js 的专题章节，最后学习测试与发布的最佳实践。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cli-design-principles","title":"CLI 设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/cli-design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"argument-parsing","title":"参数解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/argument-parsing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"io-and-streams","title":"IO 与流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/io-and-streams"},{"seq":4,"slug":"error-handling","title":"错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/foundations/error-handling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-experience","title":"用户体验","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interactive-prompts","title":"交互式提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/interactive-prompts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"progress-and-spinners","title":"进度与动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/progress-and-spinners"},{"seq":3,"slug":"color-and-formatting","title":"颜色与格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/color-and-formatting"},{"seq":4,"slug":"help-and-documentation","title":"帮助与文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/user-experience/help-and-documentation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"rust-cli","title":"Rust CLI","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clap-deep-dive","title":"Clap 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/clap-deep-dive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tokio-for-cli","title":"Tokio 异步 CLI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/tokio-for-cli"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-compilation","title":"交叉编译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/cross-compilation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"binary-optimization","title":"二进制优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/rust-cli/binary-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"nodejs-cli","title":"Node.js CLI","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-cli","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"node-cli-architecture","title":"Node CLI 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-cli/node-cli-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"process-management","title":"进程管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-cli/process-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"config-and-env","title":"配置与环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-